      "transliteration": "Namāmi dhanvantarim-ādidevaṃ, surāsurair-vandita-pāda-padmam. Loke jarā-rug-bhaya-mṛtyu-nāśaṃ, dātāram-īśaṃ vividhauṣadhīnām.",
